# Build command for the Tiler stage's Haxe source, cs target.
#
# cs was chosen for this pilot because Tiler's own runtime is already C#/.NET
# (src/Tiler, published as bin/published/Tiler) -- compiling here to the same
# ecosystem keeps a later parity/integration step a same-language comparison
# instead of also crossing a language boundary. Other stages may pick a
# different target once their representative workloads are benchmarked
# (haxe/README.md "Target selection").
#
# Run from haxe/:  haxe stages/tiler/build-cs.hxml
-cp domain
-cp stages/tiler
-main Main
-cs stages/tiler/generated-cs
